  <section class="section-case-detail section-xs pb-0">
    <div class="theme-h-line theme-outerline-left theme-outerline-right"></div>
    <div class="custom-container-1840">
      <div class="case-detail-layout">
        <!-- Left Side - Sticky -->
        <div class="case-detail-left section-xs theme-padding-xs">
          <div class="section-title">
            <h2 class="line-reveal">The Client</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="client-desc line-reveal">
            <p>
              The client was facing trouble with having to mail and explain
              their services and showcasing their supplies and spares for the
              purpose of export along with explaining the services they
              provided. They wanted to have a platform that would show all their
              dealings and area of expertise to the clients from around the
              globe.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Side - Scrollable -->
        <div class="case-detail-right">
          <div class="case-detail-block section-xs theme-padding-xs">
            <h3 class="case-detail-heading line-reveal">Core Requirements</h3>
            <div class="mocup-img">
              <picture>
                <img
                  src={`${imagesurl}case-study/all-case-study/phoenixmarine/edition.webp`}
                  alt="Core Requirements"
                  width="350"
                  height="410"
                />
              </picture>
            </div>
            <ul class="list-point">
              <li>Modern look and feel for visitors.</li>
              <li>
                A section displaying their services and dedicated fleet page
                showcasing their vessels.
              </li>
              <li>News update and contact form.</li>
              <li>
                Social media links and feeds to enable visitors to connect with
                the company on various social platforms.
              </li>
              <li>Provide tide-table and port position information.</li>
              <li>
                Provide a list of exportable items, ship spares and ship
                supplies.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-footer section-xs pt-0">
    <div class="theme-h-line theme-outerline-left"></div>
    <div class="container custom-container-1840">
      <div class="contact-us-title section-xs pb-0">
        <div class="section-title mb-0">
          <h3 class="fw-500 is-uppercase font-orbitron pl-4">Let's Talk</h3>
          <div class="theme-h-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="section-title pl-4">
